in march of 2004 when he finds his  parents who have now been relegated to  inanimate movie props he reads the  inscription on the back of it which  happens to be the same awakened spell  that tiffany used to bring back chucky  in 99  as usual the result is an overload of  electricity but the spell is successful  in bringing both dolls back to life  which later results in chucky trying to  transfer all three of their souls into  human bodies this time with the heart of  dumbella enhanced to aid him this eighth  attempt is of course unsuccessful but  this time chucky himself is the one to  stop it  this is nuts and i have a very high  tolerance for nuts if this is what it  takes to be human then i would rather  take my chances as a supernaturally  possessed doll it's less complicated  chucky decides he'd rather remain in  doll form because he feels that version  of himself is a more infamous killer  than his human form charles lee ray as i  discussed earlier dembele has and always  will be impartial to good versus evil  and allows chuckie to go on living as a  doll most likely forever however that  does not spell the end of dembele's  involvement because tiffany still wants  a human body for her and her child she  knocks out hollywood actress jennifer  tilly and performs the chant on her it  takes a few moments but after completing  the ritual she has successfully switched  into the human body just in time too  nobody leaves me tiffany takes the  amulet and uses it to transfer glenn's  soul into one of a pair of human twins  or possibly both twins it's never  explicitly explained how that all went  down either glenn is able to possess  both human bodies at once or he or she  is switching back and forth between the  two whenever he or she pleases many  years go by before chucky attempts to  contact dembele again he does so on  april 8 2013 with alice pierce the  granddaughter of one of his love  interests from 25 years ago  give me the power i beg of you we don't  actually know if he was successful with  this though but according to chuckie  himself he is able to transfer his own  soul back into a human body with the  help of a brand new voodoo spell that he  discovered on the internet  that allows him to transfer his soul  into more than one body at a time  a few years ago i came across this  groovy new spell on  voodoofordummies.com that changed  everything  now i can be me and me and me and  theoretically anyone or anything with  two legs and a hand for stabbing  like alice he takes advantage of this by  transferring himself into two duplicate  good guy dolls so now he's inhabiting  three bodies thanks to dunbella one of  them is most likely killed and the other  is captured if you want to know more  about that you gotta watch my andy  barkley horror history actually there's  three of us at the moment and the cult  is growing all the time in january 2017  the remaining one free chucky doll goes  to herogate psychiatric hospital where  he encounters two more good guy dolls  and expands his cult out into that one  interesting note about this new dembele  spell is that after the transfer the  chuckies appear to operate independently  that is they aren't a hive mind if you  share information with just one of them  the others aren't necessarily going to  know that information one of the three  chuckies at the asylum has one more task  for his voodoo overlord though roll it  [Music]  give me all the power i think of you  he uses the spell on the 29 year old  paraplegic woman in nica piers and it's  here that we see one more interesting  side effect of the power of voodoo for  the first time since she was born nika  is able to walk her legs are functional  with charles lee ray's soul taking over  her body when you think about it this  makes a lot of sense non-disabled people  are able to stand up and walk because of  the muscles in our legs exerting force a  good guy doll has no muscles but chucky  has always been able to walk while  inhabiting them that means that it's  dembele's magic that's moving them  nika's legs don't work but it's okay  because they are also moved thanks to  the might of dembele there is one more  dembele intervention that we know of  which is tiffany using the  voodoofordummies.com curse to split her  soul back into the female doll we don't  exactly know when this happens but it's  most likely the last one chronologically  with chucky back again in the 20s it's  likely that dambella will strike again  in the near future i think this is the  perfect place to end this lesson on  dembele if you like what you saw check  that playlist on the left where i  analyze the histories of other chucky  franchise characters i've also covered  deities and spirits from other  franchises such as the conjuring  franchise the world of stephen king and  others so if that interests you make  sure you subscribe to cz's world for new  horrors every week ring the death bell  for all notifications and i'll see you  in the next one assuming we both survive
 

